{"seq":2,"slug":"regression-discontinuity-design","title":"断点回归设计（RDD）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/econometrics/causal-inference/regression-discontinuity-design","wordCount":2601,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"断点回归设计-rdd\">断点回归设计（RDD）</h1><p>很多政策天然带着一条&quot;线&quot;：高考分数过了某省一本线就能报某批次院校，家庭收入低于某阈值就拿到补贴，企业员工数跨过 50 人就触发额外监管。断点回归设计（Regression Discontinuity Design, RDD）正是把这条人为划定的线，当成一台天然的随机实验机器：紧贴阈值两侧的个体在能力、收入、规模上几乎无差别，唯一的系统性差异是一侧被&quot;处理&quot;、另一侧没有。Thistlethwaite 与 Campbell 在 1960 年用奖学金资格线首次提出这一思路，而它真正成为现代因果推断的主力工具，靠的是 2008 年以后局部多项式估计与稳健推断方法的成熟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RDD 的识别基础是一个<strong>得分变量</strong>（running/score variable）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 和一个固定的<strong>断点</strong>（cutoff）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>。处理分配规则把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X \\geq c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的单位划入处理组，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X &lt; c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的划入控制组。识别参数是断点处的局部平均处理效应（local ATE）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>↓</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></munder><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>↑</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></munder><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = \\lim_{x \\downarrow c} E[Y \\mid X = x] - \\lim_{x \\uparrow c} E[Y \\mid X = x]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6382em;vertical-align:-0.8882em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↓</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">lim</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8882em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6382em;vertical-align:-0.8882em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↑</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">lim</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8882em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它成立的关键假设是<strong>连续性</strong>：在没有处理的反事实世界里，潜在结果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[Y(0)\\mid X=x]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[Y(1)\\mid X=x]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 处连续。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 在断点处任何&quot;跳变&quot;都只能归因于处理本身，而非其他混淆因素。这一点让 RDD 成为观测数据中识别可信度最高的设计之一——它不要求&quot;selection on observables&quot;那种强可忽略性，只要求阈值附近不能被精确操纵。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[得分变量 X 与断点 c] --&gt; B{X 是否可被&lt;br/&gt;精确操纵?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是, 密度跳变| X1[设计失效&lt;br/&gt;RDD 不可用]&#10;  B --&gt;|否, 密度连续| C{断点处&lt;br/&gt;处理概率如何跳?}&#10;  C --&gt;|从 0 跳到 1| D[精确断点 Sharp RD]&#10;  C --&gt;|跳幅 &lt; 1| E[模糊断点 Fuzzy RD&lt;br/&gt;用 2SLS 估 LATE]&#10;  D --&gt; F[局部线性回归&lt;br/&gt;估断点处跳变 tau]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[稳健偏差校正&lt;br/&gt;置信区间]\">flowchart TD\n  A[得分变量 X 与断点 c] --&gt; B{X 是否可被&lt;br/&gt;精确操纵?}\n  B --&gt;|是, 密度跳变| X1[设计失效&lt;br/&gt;RDD 不可用]\n  B --&gt;|否, 密度连续| C{断点处&lt;br/&gt;处理概率如何跳?}\n  C --&gt;|从 0 跳到 1| D[精确断点 Sharp RD]\n  C --&gt;|跳幅 &lt; 1| E[模糊断点 Fuzzy RD&lt;br/&gt;用 2SLS 估 LATE]\n  D --&gt; F[局部线性回归&lt;br/&gt;估断点处跳变 tau]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[稳健偏差校正&lt;br/&gt;置信区间]</pre><p>下表对比 RDD 与因果推断与现代识别策略中的其他主力设计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计</th>\n<th>核心识别假设</th>\n<th>可信度来源</th>\n<th>估计量</th>\n<th>外推性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机对照试验 RCT</td>\n<td>随机分配</td>\n<td>设计本身</td>\n<td>ATE</td>\n<td>强（取决于样本）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断点回归 RDD</td>\n<td>断点处连续性</td>\n<td>阈值附近&quot;准随机&quot;</td>\n<td>断点处局部 ATE</td>\n<td>弱（仅断点附近人群）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双重差分 DiD</td>\n<td>平行趋势</td>\n<td>时间维度反事实</td>\n<td>ATT</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具变量 IV</td>\n<td>相关性 + 排他性</td>\n<td>外生冲击</td>\n<td>LATE（依从者）</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倾向得分匹配</td>\n<td>可忽略性（强）</td>\n<td>可观测协变量</td>\n<td>ATT</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>RDD 的代价很明确：它只识别断点处那一小撮人群的效应，外部有效性天然受限。回报是其&quot;准实验&quot;地位——在所有非实验设计里，连续性假设最接近随机化，可检验性也最强。</p>\n<h2 id=\"精确断点与模糊断点\">精确断点与模糊断点</h2><p><strong>精确断点（Sharp RD）</strong> 指处理状态是得分的确定性函数：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X \\geq c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 必然被处理，处理概率从 0 跳到 1。此时断点处结果的跳变直接就是局部处理效应。中国高考的批次录取线、企业达到某规模即触发的强制性监管，都是典型 Sharp RD。</p>\n<p><strong>模糊断点（Fuzzy RD）</strong> 出现在&quot;过线&quot;只是提高而非保证处理概率的场合：比如补贴资格线把领取概率从 20% 提到 70%，但仍有人放弃、有人例外获得。此时处理概率在断点处跳幅小于 1，需要把&quot;是否跨过断点&quot;当作处理的工具变量，用两阶段最小二乘（2SLS）估计。Fuzzy RD 的估计量是结果跳变与处理概率跳变之比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>fuzzy</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>↓</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></munder><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>↑</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></munder><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>↓</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></munder><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>↑</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></munder><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{\\text{fuzzy}} = \\frac{\\lim_{x\\downarrow c}E[Y\\mid X=x] - \\lim_{x\\uparrow c}E[Y\\mid X=x]}{\\lim_{x\\downarrow c}E[D\\mid X=x] - \\lim_{x\\uparrow c}E[D\\mid X=x]}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fuzzy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3991em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lim</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↓</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lim</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↑</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lim</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↓</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lim</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↑</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是实际处理指示变量。这个比值识别的是断点附近<strong>依从者</strong>（compliers）的局部平均处理效应，与 IV 的 LATE 解释完全平行——LATE 的单调性假设、顺从者解读及「不同工具估出不同子群效应」的含义详见 <a href=\"../assumption-violations/endogeneity-and-instrumental-variables\">内生性与工具变量（2SLS）</a>。</p>\n<p>还有一类<strong>断点回归拐点设计（Regression Kink Design, RKD）</strong>：处理强度本身（而非处理与否）在断点处斜率发生扭折，比如失业救济金给付公式在某收入水平改变斜率。RKD 识别的不是水平跳变而是导数的跳变，需要对一阶导数做局部估计，相应放大了方差，对带宽与样本量更敏感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"估计-局部多项式与带宽\">估计：局部多项式与带宽</h2><p>现代 RDD 不再用全样本拟合高阶多项式（Gelman 与 Imbens 指出高阶全局多项式会在边界处产生误导性权重），而是聚焦断点邻域做<strong>局部多项式回归</strong>。标准做法是局部线性（一阶）回归，在断点两侧各拟合一条直线，外推到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 处取差。带宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 决定纳入估计的样本范围，是整个设计中最关键的调参：太窄则方差大、估计不稳，太宽则线性近似失真、引入偏差。</p>\n<p>事实上的标准工具是 Calonico、Cattaneo 与 Titiunik 等人开发的 <code>rdrobust</code> 系列包（R / Stata / Python），其 CRAN 文档与 Stata 实现在 2025 年仍持续维护（参见 <a href=\"https://rdpackages.github.io/rdrobust/\">RD Packages 官方站点</a> 与 <a href=\"http://fmwww.bc.edu/repec/bocode/r/rdrobust.pdf\">Stata rdrobust 手册</a>）。它的核心贡献有三：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数据驱动的最优带宽</strong>：用 MSE 最优或覆盖误差最优准则自动选带宽（<code>rdbwselect</code>），消除人为挑带宽的研究者自由度。</li>\n<li><strong>稳健偏差校正推断</strong>：Calonico、Cattaneo 与 Farrell（2020，<em>Econometrics Journal</em>）证明，用 MSE 最优带宽点估计会带来不可忽略的偏差，导致常规置信区间覆盖率失真；他们提出偏差校正点估计 + 调整方差的<strong>稳健置信区间</strong>（robust bias-corrected CI），是当前论文审稿的事实门槛。</li>\n<li><strong>三角核加权</strong>：靠近断点的观测权重更高，降低线性近似偏差。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始数据 Y, X] --&gt; B[rdbwselect&lt;br/&gt;选 MSE 最优带宽 h]&#10;  B --&gt; C[断点两侧&lt;br/&gt;局部线性 + 三角核]&#10;  C --&gt; D[点估计 tau-hat]&#10;  D --&gt; E[偏差校正&lt;br/&gt;稳健方差]&#10;  E --&gt; F[robust CI&lt;br/&gt;报告区间与 p 值]&#10;  C --&gt; G[rdplot&lt;br/&gt;分箱散点 + 拟合]\">graph TD\n  A[原始数据 Y, X] --&gt; B[rdbwselect&lt;br/&gt;选 MSE 最优带宽 h]\n  B --&gt; C[断点两侧&lt;br/&gt;局部线性 + 三角核]\n  C --&gt; D[点估计 tau-hat]\n  D --&gt; E[偏差校正&lt;br/&gt;稳健方差]\n  E --&gt; F[robust CI&lt;br/&gt;报告区间与 p 值]\n  C --&gt; G[rdplot&lt;br/&gt;分箱散点 + 拟合]</pre><p>报告 RDD 结果时，除点估计与稳健置信区间外，还应给出 <code>rdplot</code> 风格的可视化——把得分变量分箱后画散点叠加拟合曲线，让读者肉眼判断断点处是否真有跳变、函数形态是否被强行线性化掩盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"有效性诊断-操纵检验与安慰剂\">有效性诊断：操纵检验与安慰剂</h2><p>RDD 最致命的失效来自得分变量被<strong>精确操纵</strong>：如果个体能微调自己的得分以恰好越过断点（比如医生为让病人达标而调整诊断指标、企业为避监管而虚报员工数），断点附近的个体就不再可比。诊断这一威胁的标准方法是检验得分变量的<strong>密度</strong>在断点处是否连续。</p>\n<p>McCrary（2008）首先提出密度跳变检验；当前主流实现是 Cattaneo、Jansson 与 Ma 的局部多项式密度估计 <code>rddensity</code> 包，它只需选一个带宽、在边界处更稳健（见 <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/rddensity/rddensity.pdf\">rddensity CRAN 文档</a>）。原假设是密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 处连续，拒绝则意味着可能存在操纵——典型征兆是断点右侧&quot;堆积&quot;出异常多的观测。</p>\n<p>除密度检验外，一套完整的稳健性检查通常包含：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>诊断</th>\n<th>检验什么</th>\n<th>通过的标志</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>密度检验（rddensity）</td>\n<td>得分变量是否被操纵</td>\n<td>断点处密度无显著跳变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协变量平衡</td>\n<td>前定协变量是否在断点处跳变</td>\n<td>各协变量跳变均不显著</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安慰剂断点</td>\n<td>在非真实断点处是否出现假效应</td>\n<td>假断点处估计接近 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽敏感性</td>\n<td>结论是否依赖单一带宽</td>\n<td>多个带宽下方向/显著性稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>局部随机化</td>\n<td>窄窗内&quot;准随机&quot;是否成立</td>\n<td>作为连续性方法的稳健性补充</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得强调的是<strong>局部随机化（local randomization）方法</strong>与连续性方法的分工。当得分变量连续时，局部随机化通常要求比连续性更强的假设，因此 Cattaneo、Idrobo 与 Titiunik 在其方法学专著中建议：以连续性方法做主分析，把局部随机化当作稳健性检查；只有当得分变量离散、断点附近取值很少时，局部随机化才更自然地成为主方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿与边界\">前沿与边界</h2><p>RDD 方法学在 2024–2025 仍在活跃推进。一个重要方向是<strong>多维 / 几何断点</strong>：当处理由空间边界（如警区、学区、行政区划边界）决定时，得分是二维坐标，需要专门估计。Cattaneo、Titiunik 与 Yu 于 2025 年发布的 <code>rd2d</code> 包（CRAN，2025 年 10 月）提供了二维 RDD 的数据驱动带宽选择与稳健推断（见 <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/rd2d/rd2d.pdf\">rd2d CRAN 文档</a>）；几何 RDD 的稳健推断也出现在 2025 年 <em>JRSS Series A</em> 的警区影响评估等应用研究中。另一前沿是把机器学习引入函数形态估计（如部分线性 RDD），在保持断点处识别的同时放松对回归函数的参数假设。</p>\n<p>理解 RDD 的边界同样重要。它识别的永远是<strong>断点处那一类人群</strong>的局部效应——把高考一本线附近学生的回报外推到全体考生，在方法上没有依据。它也无法回答&quot;如果把断点移到别处会怎样&quot;，因为那需要在新位置重新观测连续性。在中国的政策评估实践中，RDD 因大量行政阈值（录取线、低保线、规模监管线）而应用广泛；2025 年国内方法学综述也把它列为与 DiD、IV 并列的因果识别三大支柱之一（见 <a href=\"https://cssn.cn/jjx/jjxyjff/202512/t20251225_5962894.shtml\">中国社会科学网《断点回归设计的实证指南》</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RDD 把行政阈值变成天然实验：紧贴断点两侧的个体准随机可比，识别断点处局部处理效应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>核心假设是<strong>断点处潜在结果连续</strong>——比可忽略性弱、比随机化只差一点，可信度在非实验设计中最高。</li>\n<li><strong>Sharp RD</strong> 处理概率从 0 跳到 1，直接读跳变；<strong>Fuzzy RD</strong> 跳幅 &lt;1，用 2SLS 估依从者 LATE；<strong>RKD</strong> 看斜率扭折。</li>\n<li>估计用<strong>局部线性 + 三角核</strong>，避免全局高阶多项式；带宽用数据驱动准则选，并报告 <code>rdrobust</code> 的<strong>稳健偏差校正置信区间</strong>。</li>\n<li>有效性靠组合诊断保证：<code>rddensity</code> 操纵检验、协变量平衡、安慰剂断点、带宽敏感性；局部随机化通常作连续性方法的补充。</li>\n<li>前沿走向多维/几何断点（2025 年 <code>rd2d</code>）与机器学习辅助的函数形态估计；但 RDD 始终只识别断点附近人群，外推须谨慎。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"断点回归设计（RDD）","id":"断点回归设计-rdd"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"精确断点与模糊断点","id":"精确断点与模糊断点"},{"level":2,"text":"估计：局部多项式与带宽","id":"估计-局部多项式与带宽"},{"level":2,"text":"有效性诊断：操纵检验与安慰剂","id":"有效性诊断-操纵检验与安慰剂"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿与边界","id":"前沿与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"双重差分与事件研究","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/econometrics/causal-inference/difference-in-differences"},"next":{"title":"面板数据与固定效应模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/econometrics/causal-inference/panel-data-and-fixed-effects"}}